<title>USA: Shandong Huaneng 1H net income up 19.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Shandong Huaneng 1H net income up 19.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>	  6   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr ADR	   RMB 4.7		  RMB 3.92</p>
<p> Net		 404.53		   338.3</p>
<p> Revs		1,327.8		  1,153.2</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the Board of Directors has decided on an interim dividend of RMB0.2 per share. Shandong Huaneng Chairman Yu Xinyang said: &quot;The company's strong performance reflects both the approval of our tariff increase for 1996 as well as the fact that output for the first half exceeded that of the same period in 1995.&quot;</p>
</text>
